  "question": {
    "text": "If the points&nbsp;with position vectors&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are collinear, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>19</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;",
    "image": null
